  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "One of the strangest and most enigmatic of the major races is without doubt the living shadow-things we call the Tenebrhae. Hailing from the darkest worlds, they are quite literally the essence of shadow given form. It defies all known logic and science, leading many to wonder if they may be some fragment of a literal greater power. All we know for certain is that they are all connected on some level we cannot begin to comprehend.",
    "value": "最奇特、最神秘的主要种族之一，无疑是那些我们称为“影裔”的活体影状存在。他们来自最黑暗的世界，毫不夸张地说，他们是“被赋予形态的影之本质”。这一存在违背了一切已知的逻辑与科学，令许多人怀疑他们是否某种更宏大实体力量的碎片。我们唯一能确定的是，他们在某种我们无法理解的层面上彼此相连。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "This means that every single one of them knows the rest, perhaps even intimately. There are no strangers among their kind, but likewise, no real known language either. They speak, but not in a way that makes sense to most. Often it takes the form of what we would refer to as riddles, if they speak at all. They'll answer questions with questions (or not answer at all, or will answer in a way that baffles us. Most often, by",
    "value": "这意味着他们每一个个体都知晓其他所有个体，甚至可能极为熟悉。同族之中没有陌生人，但同样地，他们也没有真正的语言。他们确实会“说话”，但方式对大多数人而言难以理解。即便开口，也往往以我们所称的“谜语”形式呈现：他们会用问题来回答问题（或根本不回答，或以令人困惑的方式回应，最常见的是，对那些本无是非答案的问题作出肯定或否定的答复）。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "responding in the affirmative or negative to questions that have no yes or no answer). This species, likewise, appears impossible to anger. They do not fight amongst themselves, and will almost never lash out at others without good reason. They do not display any outward emotion that we can define, leading many to believe they are mindless automatons that serve a single Hive Mind at their center. This is false, however, as they",
    "value": "同样，这一种族似乎从不会被激怒。他们不内斗，也几乎从不无故攻击他人。他们不显露任何我们所能定义的外在情感，这使得许多人认为他们是无意识的自动机械，服务于某个核心的蜂巢思维。"
